## Citation

If you use Wood-Chip Monitor in academic work, please cite the associated system publication:

> A. Eskorouchi, P. Bhattarai, A. Rahman, M. Marufuzzaman, J. T. Street, and H. Wang,  
> **"An Edge Artificial Intelligence System for Wood Chip Quality Evaluation,"**  
> *Proceedings of the IISE Annual Conference & Expo 2026*, 2026.

Machine-readable citation metadata is provided in [`CITATION.cff`](CITATION.cff).